MERN Polls App

A real-time Polling Web Application built using the MERN Stack.

About

MERN Polls App allows users to create polls and vote on different options in real time.

Features

- Create Polls
- Vote on Polls
- Real-Time Polling
- View Poll Results
- Responsive User Interface

Technologies Used

- MongoDB
- Express.js
- React.js
- Node.js

